close_comment = "The original CA certificate is now tracked at tests/fixtures/repair_22_31_227_fixture/ca.pem in the agent SDK, matching both audit-test consumers. The certificate has an explicit ignore exception and fixture inventory checks that require it to remain tracked and present."
